980
01:06:45.417 --> 01:06:46.124
It's too expensive.

981
01:06:46.125 --> 01:06:47.542
Let's take our time and look.

982
01:06:48.375 --> 01:06:50.625
Or I can stay in the
domintory for a few days.

983
01:06:52.167 --> 01:06:53.457
I'll pay for one then.

984
