1051
01:11:54.833 --> 01:11:56.499
I already explained it to her.

1052
01:11:56.500 --> 01:11:59.166
"Apartment Rental Agreement"

1053
01:11:59.167 --> 01:12:00.082
Later,

1054
01:12:00.083 --> 01:12:01.332
