be here, how's that?

1144
01:17:50.167 --> 01:17:51.582
I think it's pretty nice.

1145
01:17:51.583 --> 01:17:52.583
See?

1146
01:17:53.208 --> 01:17:55.124
It's good, it's good.

1147
01:17:55.125 --> 01:17:56.541
Chinese restaurants are the best,

1148
01:17:56.542 --> 01:17:58.124
