- That's the most important.

1150
01:18:01.333 --> 01:18:02.541
Just look.

1151
01:18:02.542 --> 01:18:03.707
Just think, all these years.

1152
01:18:03.708 --> 01:18:04.624
I thought,

1153
01:18:04.625 --> 01:18:06.666
