1156
01:18:10.458 --> 01:18:11.458
That's right.

1157
01:18:15.500 --> 01:18:16.900
Move it 10 centimeters to the left.

1158
01:18:17.792 --> 01:18:19.917
Move back, aboutˇ

1159
01:18:20.792 --> 01:18:21.792
4 steps.

1160
01:18:36.542 --> 01:18:37.916
Hello, please sit.

1161
01:18:37.917 --> 01:18:41.417
