1162
01:18:45.750 --> 01:18:47.000
Teacher Yao.

1163
01:18:52.583 --> 01:18:54.832
You'reˇyou'reˇ

1164
01:18:54.833 --> 01:18:56.458
Lu Qinyang,

1165
01:18:58.000 --> 01:18:59.541
