I don't even remember.

1242
01:23:17.208 --> 01:23:18.208
Lu Qinyang.

1243
01:23:19.208 --> 01:23:20.542
I'm getting married.

1244
01:23:24.667 --> 01:23:26.708
It's like how we imagined

1245
01:23:27.417 --> 01:23:29.624
