1248
01:23:33.458 --> 01:23:35.083
All that's missing is you.

1249
01:23:38.958 --> 01:23:39.958
Wait.

1250
01:23:40.417 --> 01:23:42.291
Who's reckless enough

1251
01:23:42.292 --> 01:23:43.792
