1301
01:27:50.083 --> 01:27:51.667
Lu, do you copy?

1302
01:27:52.333 --> 01:27:53.833
Lu Qinyang, do you copy?

1303
01:27:54.875 --> 01:27:57.625
LuˇLu Qinyang, do you copy?

1304
