Ling Yiyao: I'm here,
waiting at the station

1307
01:28:33.667 --> 01:28:34.416
Brother!

1308
01:28:34.417 --> 01:28:36.499
Lu!

1309
01:28:36.500 --> 01:28:38.624
Lu!

1310
01:28:38.625 --> 01:28:40.166
Third Uncle,

1311
01:28:40.167 --> 01:28:41.416
